        "founder_name": "James Carter",
        "founder_role": "Founder of Up Men",
        "intro_title_pre": "WHY I CREATED",
        "intro_title_highlight": "UP MEN",
        "intro_text": "A few years ago I was doing everything \"right\" — training, working hard, grinding — and still dealing with:",
        "struggles": "Low Energy|Brain Fog|Slow Recovery|Low Drive",
        "intro_footer": "And more things I won't bore you by listing…",
        "story_p1": "Every day felt like a battle. I was running on caffeine and willpower, and it still wasn't enough.",
        "story_p2": "I looked fine on the outside, but I knew I wasn't performing at my real level.",
        "story_p3": "Then I got my testosterone tested — and everything made sense.",
        "story_p4": "I went all-in on understanding what actually moves the needle for male hormones, naturally.",
        "before_after_image": "shopify://shop_images/9_0ba2db66-ae20-41ea-b532-b04ba68d585c.jpg",
        "tried_title": "I TRIED EVERYTHING:",
        "tried_list": "More caffeine|Generic multivitamins|Random T-boosters|Crash diets|Cold showers|Sleep hacks|Expensive clinics|And more",
        "tried_image": "shopify://shop_images/emagrecer-1920x1080.jpg",
        "follow_title_pre": "THE ANSWER WAS",
        "follow_title_highlight": "SIMPLER THAN I THOUGHT",
        "follow_p1": "Don't get me wrong — some of those habits are good, and I still keep them today. But none of them were the game-changer I was looking for.",
        "follow_p2": "What actually worked was giving my body the exact raw materials it needs to produce testosterone on its own: clinically dosed Tongkat Ali, Shilajit, Zinc, Boron, Fenugreek and more — all in one daily serving.",
        "follow_p3": "That's Up Men. No hormones, no shortcuts — just your body working the way it was designed to."
      }
